                                                "example_id": "1150724b-beaf-4d70-8196-3171afd958d2",
                                                "sense_id": "b4d3d74d-d091-33c5-ab9c-547f6e37aff0",
                                                "text": "It has changed the way cleaning is carried out, right down to replacing anti-bacterial wipes with microfibre cloths that are more effective at removing any virus."
